{"type":"message","id":"fa4f76f8","parentId":"4d661964","timestamp":"2026-03-13T06:47:57.673Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Fri 2026-03-13 14:47 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 【打包准备 - PyInstaller】\n\n## 任务\n准备 PyInstaller 打包，确保可执行文件生成顺利。\n\n## 打包清单\n\n### 1. 依赖确认\n```bash\n# 确认 requirements.txt\nPyQt6>=6.4.0\nSQLAlchemy>=2.0.0\npython-dateutil>=2.8.2\npyinstaller>=6.0.0\n```\n\n### 2. 打包脚本\n创建 `build.bat` (Windows):\n```batch\n@echo off\necho Building Todo Calendar...\npyinstaller --onefile --windowed --name=\"Todo Calendar\" --icon=assets/icon.ico main.py\necho Build complete!\npause\n```\n\n### 3. 配置文件\n创建 `todo_calendar.spec`:\n- 包含所有数据文件\n- 包含 SQLite 数据库\n- 包含 QSS 样式表\n\n### 4. 启动脚本\n创建 `start.bat`:\n```batch\n@echo off\ncd /d \"%~dp0\"\nTodo Calendar.exe\n```\n\n### 5. 测试打包\n- 在干净环境测试\n- 确认无需 Python 环境即可运行\n- 验证数据持久化\n\n## 时间要求\n- 15:30: 完成打包脚本\n- 16:00: 完成首次打包测试\n- 17:00: 完成最终打包\n\n## 输出\n- build.bat\n- todo_calendar.spec\n- start.bat\n- Todo Calendar.exe (测试版)\n\n**立即开始准备！**"}],"timestamp":1773384477667}}
