{"type":"message","id":"48b1ef51","parentId":"374754a6","timestamp":"2026-03-13T06:48:25.202Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have all the project structure information needed, so I'll create the build.bat script for Windows PyInstaller packaging.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Now I have a good understanding of the project structure. Let me create the required packaging files:\n\n1. **build.bat** - Windows build script\n2. **todo_calendar.spec** - Update the spec file to include all necessary files\n3. **start.bat** - Launch script\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6f91b4544e3141138a57bd84","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"@echo off\necho ========================================\necho Building Todo Calendar...\necho ========================================\necho.\n\nREM Check if Python is available\npython --version >nul 2>&1\nif errorlevel 1 (\n    echo ERROR: Python is not installed or not in PATH\n    echo Please install Python 3.8+ and add it to PATH\n    pause\n    exit /b 1\n)\n\nREM Check if PyInstaller is installed\npyinstaller --version >nul 2>&1\nif errorlevel 1 (\n    echo Installing PyInstaller...\n    pip install pyinstaller>=6.0.0\n)\n\necho.\necho Starting build process...\necho.\n\nREM Run PyInstaller with spec file\npyinstaller todo_calendar.spec\n\necho.\necho ========================================\nif exist \"dist\\Todo Calendar.exe\" (\n    echo Build SUCCESSFUL!\n    echo Executable: dist\\Todo Calendar.exe\n) else (\n    echo Build FAILED!\n    echo Please check the error messages above\n)\necho ========================================\necho.\npause\n","path":"/home/admin/.openclaw/workspace/todo-calendar/build.bat"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"dashscope-coding","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":24750,"output":381,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25131,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"s