{"type":"message","id":"c1334d28","parentId":"512d3d90","timestamp":"2026-03-13T06:51:42.369Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_f7f5609e300f4ae8b94257d5","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 打包文件清单 ===\n-rw-r--r-- 1 admin admin  925 Mar 13 14:48 build.bat\n-rw-r--r-- 1 admin admin 3.1K Mar 13 14:49 BUILD_GUIDE.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 admin admin 2.8K Mar 13 14:51 PACKAGING_CHECKLIST.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 admin admin 4.1K Mar 13 14:51 PACKAGING_README.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 admin admin  218 Mar 13 14:48 requirements.txt\n-rw-r--r-- 1 admin admin  391 Mar 13 14:48 start.bat\n-rw-r--r-- 1 admin admin 3.6K Mar 13 14:49 test_build.py\n-rw-r--r-- 1 admin admin 2.5K Mar 13 14:48 todo_calendar.spec\n\n=== 文件预览 ===\n\n--- build.bat ---\n@echo off\necho ========================================\necho Building Todo Calendar...\necho ========================================\necho.\n\n--- start.bat ---\n@echo off\nREM Todo Calendar - Launch Script\nREM This script launches the Todo Calendar application\n\nREM Change to the directory where this script is located\ncd /d \"%~dp0\"\n\nREM Launch the application\nif exist \"Todo Calendar.exe\" (\n    start \"\" \"Todo Calendar.exe\"\n) else (\n    echo ERROR: Todo Calendar.exe not found!\n    echo Please run build.bat first to create the executable.\n    pause\n)\n\n--- requirements.txt ---\n# Todo Calendar - Python 依赖\n# 生产环境最小依赖\n\n# UI Framework\nPyQt6>=6.4.0\nPyQt6-Qt6>=6.4.0\n\n# Database ORM\nSQLAlchemy>=2.0.0\n\n# Date Utilities\npython-dateutil>=2.8.2\n\n# Build & Package\npyinstaller>=6.0.0"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":116,"aggregated":"=== 打包文件清单 ===\n-rw-r--r-- 1 admin admin  925 Mar 13 14:48 build.bat\n-rw-r--r-- 1 admin admin 3.1K Mar 13 14:49 BUILD_GUIDE.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 admin admin 2.8K Mar 13 14:51 PACKAGING_CHECKLIST.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 admin admin 4.1K Mar 13 14:51 PACKAGING_README.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 admin admin  218 Mar 13 14:48 requirements.txt\n-rw-r--r-- 1 admin admin  391 Mar 13 14:48 start.bat\n-rw-r--r-- 1 admin admin 3.6K Mar 13 14:49 test_build.py\n-rw-r--r-- 1 admin admin 2.5K Mar 13 14:48 todo_calendar.spec\n\n=== 文件预览 ===\n\n--- build.bat ---\n@echo off\necho ========================================\necho Building Todo Calendar...\necho ========================================\necho.\n\n--- start.bat ---\n@echo off\nREM Todo Calendar - Launch Script\nREM This script launches the Todo Calendar application\n\nREM Change to the directory where this script is located\ncd /d \"%~dp0\"\n\nREM Launch the application\nif exist \"Todo Calendar.exe\" (\n    start \"\" \"Todo Calendar.exe\"\n) else (\n    echo ERROR: Todo Calendar.exe not found!\n    echo Please run build.bat first to create the executable.\n    pause\n)\n\n--- requirements.txt ---\n# Todo Calendar - Python 依赖\n# 生产环境最小依赖\n\n# UI Framework\nPyQt6>=6.4.0\nPyQt6-Qt6>=6.4.0\n\n# Database ORM\nSQLAlchemy>=2.0.0\n\n# Date Utilities\npython-dateutil>=2.8.2\n\n# Build & Package\npyinstaller>=6.0.0","cwd":"/home/admin/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773384702363}}
{"type":"message","id":"2f44585d","parentId":"c1334d28","timestamp":"2026-03-13T06:52:13.456Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All packaging files have been created and verified - now I need to provide a comprehensive summary to the main agent documenting what was accomplished and what's needed next.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All files are created successfully. Let me create a final summary report:\n\n## ✅ 打包准备任务完成报告\n\n### 📦 已创建文件清单\n\n| 文件 | 大小 | 说明 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|------|\n| **build.bat** | 925 B | Windows 打包脚本 | ✅ |\n| **start.bat** | 391 B | 应用启动脚本 | ✅ |\n| **todo_calendar.spec** | 2.5 KB | PyInstaller 配置文件 | ✅ |\n| **requirements.txt** | 218 B | 生产环境依赖 | ✅ |\n| **BUILD_GUIDE.md** | 3.1 KB | 完整打包指南 | ✅ |\n| **PACKAGING_README.md** | 4.1 KB | 环境要求与说明 | ✅ |\n| **PACKAGING_CHECKLIST.md** | 2.8 KB | 打包检查清单 | ✅ |\n| **test_build.py** | 3.6 KB | 打包测试脚本 | ✅ |\n\n### 📋 打包清单完成情况\n\n#### ✅ 1. 依赖确认\n- `requirements.txt` 已优化，包含：\n  - PyQt6>=6.4.0\n  - PyQt6-Qt6>=6.4.0\n  - SQLAlchemy>=2.0.0\n  - python-dateutil>=2.8.2\n  - pyinstaller>=6.0.0\n\n#### ✅ 2. 打包脚本\n- `build.bat` 已创建，功能：\n  - 自动检查 Python 环境\n  - 自动安装 PyInstaller（如缺失）\n  - 使用 spec 文件打包\n  - 显示构建结果\n\n#### ✅ 3. 配置文件\n- `todo_calendar.spec` 已更新，包含：\n  - assets 资源文件\n  - QSS 样式表 (default.qss)\n  - 数据目录 (src/data/)\n  - 所有 PyQt6 二进制文件\n  - SQLAlchemy 及 SQLite 方言\n  - python-dateutil 模块\n  - 排除不必要的模块（减小体积）\n\n#### ✅ 4. 启动脚本\n- `start.bat` 已创建，功能：\n  - 自动切换到程序目录\n  - 启动 Todo Calendar.exe\n  - 友好的错误提示\n\n#### ⚠️ 5. 测试打包\n- **当前环境限制**：服务器 Python 3.6.8 不支持 PyQt6\n- **需要环境**：Windows 10/11 + Python 3.8+（推荐 3.10+）\n- **测试脚本**：`test_build.py` 已准备就绪\n\n### 🎯 时间要求对比\n\n| 里程碑 | 要求时间 | 实际完成 | 状态 |\n|--------|----------|----------|------|\n| 完成打包脚本 | 15:30 | 14:48 | ✅ 提前 42 分钟 |\n| 完成首次打包测试 | 16:00 | 待 Windows 环境 | ⏳ 环境限制 |\n| 完成最终打包 | 17:00 | 待 Windows 环境 | ⏳ 环境限制 |\n\n### 📁 输出文件\n\n所有必需文件已准备在 `/home/admin/.openclaw/workspace/todo-calendar/`：\n- ✅ build.bat\n- ✅ todo_calendar.spec\n- ✅ start.bat\n- ⏳ Todo Calendar.exe (需在 Windows 环境生成)\n\n### ⚠️ 重要提示\n\n**当前服务器无法执行打包**，因为：\n- Python 版本过低 (3.6.8)，PyQt6 需要 3.8+\n- 这是 Windows 打包任务，需要在 Windows 环境执行\n\n**解决方案**：\n1. 在 Windows 10/11 机器上执行（推荐）\n2. 安装 Python 3.10+ 后运行 `build.bat`\n\n### 📞 下一步操作\n\n在 Windows 环境执行以下命令：\n\n```batch\ncd todo-calendar\npip install -r requirements.txt\nbuild.bat\n```\n\n打包完成后，在 `dist/Todo Calendar/` 目录找到生成的可执行文件。\n\n---\n\n**打包准备状态**: ✅ 100% 完成  \n**等待条件**: Windows 环境 (Python 3.8+)  \n**交付时间**: 14:51 (提前 39 分钟完成准备)"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"dashscope-coding","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":43308,"output":1041,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44349,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773384702370}}
